👑🧠 Birbal and the Shorter Line (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar drew a long line on the floor.

He said, “Can anyone make this line shorter without touching it?”

Many people tried but failed.

Then Birbal came forward.

He drew a longer line next to the first one.

Now, the original line looked shorter.

Akbar smiled.

“That is clever!” he said.

💖 Moral:

You can change perspective without changing reality.
